Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:07.87,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\an7\fad(435,0)\fs72\bord2\c&H3BB43A&\3c&HDCFDDD&\b1\pos(163.21,221.867)\frz14.82}搞烏龍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.50,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\an2\bord4\fs60\pos(960,788.399)}夏菜做的可好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.59,0:21:20.38,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\an8\bord4\fs72\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&H94928F&}炸糖蛋球
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:28.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗雅宋_GBK\an8\fs90\b1}其他班級 襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:38.90,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正粗雅宋_GBK\an8\fs90\b1}其他學校 襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:50.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\an2\bord4\fs60\pos(960,950.588)}一臉不知道在這種時候
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:52.67,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\an2\bord4\fs60\pos(960,950.588)}該露出什麼表情的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,行ってきまーす
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:13.82,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,俺は中村照秋
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.25,0:00:13.82,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我叫中村照秋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:18.34,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,この春　東京から沖縄の学校に転入してきた
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.87,0:00:18.34,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,今年春天從東京轉學到了沖繩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:27.87,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー　おはよー!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.20,0:00:27.87,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 早安!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.95,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,好きな人は　うちなーぐち
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.95,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我喜歡的人 愛說沖繩方言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:34.72,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜屋武さん　 おふ…おはよう
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.74,0:00:34.72,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜屋武 朝…早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:35.98,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,噛んだ…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.24,0:00:35.98,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,咬舌了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.79,0:00:38.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,好きな人と上手く話せない
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.79,0:00:38.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,和喜歡的人沒辦法順利溝通
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.21,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,漫画でよく聞く台詞だけど
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.21,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,漫畫裡經常看到的這句台詞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.40,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,俺もそうみたいだ
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.21,0:00:42.40,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,沒想到如今也輪到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.29,0:00:46.17,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,いや～　今朝はでーじだったねぇ
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.29,0:00:46.17,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哎喲 今早真是背時啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.12,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え?　デジ…?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.12,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊? 背時…?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.12,0:00:48.90,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,だけど…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.12,0:00:48.90,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.51,0:00:59.19,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんて!?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.51,0:00:59.19,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,她在說什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:01.92,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,俺の初恋…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.76,0:01:01.92,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我的初戀…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.02,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うまく話せないの意味が違う!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.56,0:01:05.02,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是另一種意義的沒辦法順利溝通!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.24,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖縄の学校に転入し
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.24,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我轉學到了沖繩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:10.04,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,好きな子もできてしまったが…
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.56,0:03:10.04,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,在這裡也結識到了喜歡的女孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:13.10,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,その好きな子の方言が分からなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.43,0:03:13.10,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,但是我聽不懂喜歡的女孩說的方言
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.05,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うまく話せない
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.10,0:03:14.05,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,所以不能很好地和她交談
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:26.42,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,何言ってるか分からないけど
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.88,0:03:26.42,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,聽不懂她在說些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:27.35,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ポリポリしてる
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.42,0:03:27.35,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,只看到她在撓她的臉蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:29.59,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,でもカワイイ…
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.66,0:03:29.59,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,真可愛…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.11,0:03:32.91,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「先のゲリラ豪雨大変だったよー」
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.11,0:03:32.91,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「剛才的暴雨真糟糕啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:35.56,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,って言ってるさー
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.19,0:03:35.56,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她是這麼說的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:40.12,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉さん　あ…ありがとう
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.05,0:03:40.12,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉 謝…謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:45.23,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,みんなは喜屋武さんのうちなーぐちが聞き取れる様で羨ましい
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.53,0:03:45.23,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,大家可以聽懂喜屋武的沖繩方言 真羨慕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:48.35,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜屋武さんと比嘉さんは仲良しだ
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.27,0:03:48.35,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜屋武和比嘉是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.04,0:03:52.98,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うちなーぐちを教えてくれる比嘉さんにはいつも助けられている
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.04,0:03:52.98,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,教我沖繩方言的比嘉 幫了我很多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:58.43,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「黒糖食べる?」だってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.53,0:03:58.43,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她問「你要吃黑糖嗎?」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:03.10,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「頑張ってー」ってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.89,0:04:03.10,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她叫你「加油」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.60,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「また明日ね」って
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.60,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她說「明天見」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.56,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「本当に?」ってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.56,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她說「真的嗎?」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.78,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「行くよー」ってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.78,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她說「要上了哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:17.28,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「いいね」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.37,0:04:17.28,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「真不錯」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:19.87,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「オーマイゴッド」
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.73,0:04:19.87,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「Oh my god」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:27.16,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉さん　いつもごめんね
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.26,0:04:27.16,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉 一直麻煩你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:29.82,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,これ　お礼に
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.59,0:04:29.82,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這個給你 就當是謝禮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:34.13,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,…別にいいのに
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.70,0:04:34.13,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,…不用這麼費心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:36.00,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,いつでも教えるさー
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.48,0:04:36.00,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我隨時都可以教你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:37.94,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ありがと…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.18,0:04:37.94,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,謝謝…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:43.87,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,でも沖縄の方言は難しいね
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.48,0:04:43.87,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不過沖繩方言真難學啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:45.70,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なかなか覚えられないや
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.17,0:04:45.70,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我總是記不住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:48.84,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,言えない…
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.99,0:04:48.84,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,說不出口…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:54.24,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,話すきっかけが欲しくてうちなーぐちを教えてるなんて
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.39,0:04:54.24,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我為了製造聊天的契機才教他方言的這份心思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:59.06,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,別に無理に覚えなくてもいいさー
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.99,0:04:59.06,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你也不用勉強自己記住啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:05.83,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ストップ!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.60,0:05:05.83,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,停停!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:07.70,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,チラシニアカイ?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.21,0:05:07.70,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,臉 非紅?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.83,0:05:10.01,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,し…知らんでいいばーよ!!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.83,0:05:10.01,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,聽…聽不懂沒關係!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:10.54,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え!?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.01,0:05:10.54,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:15.50,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,よかった!てーるーがうちなーぐち分からなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.80,0:05:15.50,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,太好了!阿照聽不懂沖繩方言真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:34.58,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え?　喜屋武さんやっぱり方言がすごすぎてツラすぎます!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.68,0:05:34.58,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊? 喜屋武的方言太重了 我聽不懂一點!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あっ　比嘉さんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.86,0:05:37.96,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是比嘉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.32,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あい　ほんとだー
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.32,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真的撒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.36,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,おーい
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.36,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:42.86,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉さーん
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.92,0:05:42.86,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:43.61,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,て…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.13,0:05:43.61,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:45.05,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉さーん
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.90,0:05:45.05,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:45.05,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ちょ…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.47,0:05:45.05,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.17,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ん!?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.17,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.55,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ん? あれ…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.55,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯? 奇怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:54.87,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あいえな～
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.93,0:05:54.87,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不好了~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:55.65,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんか…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.87,0:05:55.65,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,怎麼感覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:05:59.04,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,呼んだか?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.91,0:05:59.04,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你叫我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:00.51,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え?　いや…
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.04,0:06:00.51,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊? 不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:01.62,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,私ー?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.89,0:06:01.62,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,叫我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:02.76,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,い…いや
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.95,0:06:02.76,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.12,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,はいさいー
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.12,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,吃飯沒得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:04.99,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え!?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.51,0:06:04.99,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:06.60,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.68,0:06:06.60,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:07.26,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ワット!?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.60,0:06:07.26,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:09.78,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うぉお!?　なんだ　なんだ!?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.60,0:06:09.78,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊!? 怎麼了 怎麼了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:10.64,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,わー?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.09,0:06:10.64,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:11.87,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,わんのこと?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.93,0:06:11.87,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,找我?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:13.27,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,呼ばんかった?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.36,0:06:13.27,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,叫我撒?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:16.72,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えっと…俺が呼んだのは比嘉さんで…え?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.61,0:06:16.72,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那個…我喊的是比嘉…?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.97,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉だけとー?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.97,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,就是比嘉啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:22.07,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,みんな比嘉さん?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.97,0:06:22.07,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,大家都是比嘉!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えらい目にあった…
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.96,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,剛才真是惹大禍了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.83,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,人混みで比嘉さんなんて呼んだら
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.83,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你在人群中喊比嘉的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.05,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うちなーはよ
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.05,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,在沖繩這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.76,0:06:38.05,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「沖縄は比嘉姓ばっかりなのよー」ってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.76,0:06:38.05,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她說「沖繩到處都是姓比嘉的人」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉なんて名前沖縄じゃ腐るほどいるわけさー
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.54,0:06:41.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉這個姓 在沖繩屬於爛大街了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:44.93,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんで　かーなーは腐らんさー
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.35,0:06:44.93,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,說什麼嘛 夏菜就不爛撒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:46.61,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,わからんさー
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.31,0:06:46.61,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那就不曉得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:49.60,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんでよ
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.76,0:06:49.60,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.48,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,でも今朝はゾンビ映画並の迫力だったな…
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.48,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不過今早 確認是有喪屍電影般的壓迫感…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.77,0:06:56.68,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,て~る~
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.77,0:06:56.68,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,照~秋~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:58.72,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,呼んだば~?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.99,0:06:58.72,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你叫我嗎~?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.56,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ハイサイ~
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.56,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,吃飯沒得~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.70,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,まあ「田中」みたいなもんなのかな?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.00,0:07:05.70,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哦 是不是就相當於「田中」這個姓?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:08.24,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,田中さんは珍しいさー!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.05,0:07:08.24,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,田中可稀奇了!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:09.98,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,激レアだよ　田中さんはー!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.24,0:07:09.98,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,田中在沖繩可是爆款啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:11.85,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,田中さん　激レアなの!?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.29,0:07:11.85,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,田中竟然很稀有嗎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:16.58,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,と…とりあえず　比嘉さんを呼ぶ時は気を付けないとな
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.96,0:07:16.58,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯…總之 下次喊比嘉的時候要留心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:20.47,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,また迷惑かけちゃうし…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.03,0:07:20.47,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不然又得給大家添麻煩…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.73,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,下の名前で呼べばいいのに…
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.73,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,直接叫名字不就好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.98,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あーたしかに!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.42,0:07:28.98,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哦 對啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.77,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,だから沖縄の人って名前呼び多いのか!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.40,0:07:31.77,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,所以沖繩很多人以名字相呼嗎!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:33.85,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あっ声に出てた?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.11,0:07:33.85,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊 我說出口了?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:37.85,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,だーるさー　うちなーでは同じ姓が多いから
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.24,0:07:37.85,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,對頭 我們沖繩有很多同姓的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.76,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,名前で呼ばんとへんなーよー
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.76,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,所以不用名字稱呼會很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.11,0:07:42.90,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かーなーってかわいい名前があるからさー
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.11,0:07:42.90,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,而且夏菜這個名字多乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.23,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,呼んであげんとねぇ
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.23,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不多叫一哈嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:48.05,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「沖縄では同じ苗字が多いから」
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.24,0:07:48.05,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「沖繩有很多同姓的人」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:50.35,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「名前で呼ばないと変だよー」
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.34,0:07:50.35,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「不喊名字的話會很奇怪的」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:53.28,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「別に深い意味はないよ?」だってよ!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.35,0:07:53.28,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「你不要想太多了?」 她說!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.50,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,へー
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.50,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:57.02,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,またね!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.06,0:07:57.02,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,明天見!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.11,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,たーつー　帰ろう
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.11,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我們也回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:07:59.50,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,おお　帰るか
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.11,0:07:59.50,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.32,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,待って
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.48,0:08:01.32,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:11.82,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あ　比嘉さん　おーい
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.94,0:08:11.82,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是比嘉 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:12.39,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比…っ
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.82,0:08:12.39,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:19.79,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あっぶねええええ!　また今朝みたいになるとこだったああ!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.50,0:08:19.79,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,好險! 差點又要重演早上的事情了!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:25.20,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,女の人を名前呼びするのはちょっと照れるけど
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.92,0:08:25.20,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,雖然直接叫女孩子的名字有點害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:28.97,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あい
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.36,0:08:28.97,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:31.66,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てー…
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.17,0:08:31.66,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,照…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.80,0:08:33.07,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かなさーん
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.80,0:08:33.07,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,夏菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.00,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ん?　なんか…　また…
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.08,0:08:45.00,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯? 怎麼感覺…又叫錯了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:52.90,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えーにーにーよ　あんたよ若いのに　ろまんてぃっくやさー
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.87,0:08:52.90,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,小兄弟 年紀輕輕卻這麼浪漫撒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.01,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.01,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.10,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,でもちょっぴぐわ
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.10,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不過有點我要跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:09:00.09,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「かなさん」の発音が変さー
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.12,0:09:00.09,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「我愛你」的發音有些怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.32,Sub-JP-NEW,这里的⤴加到さ的上面,0,0,0,,{\fnSegoe UI Symbol\pos(796.401,1021.998)}⤴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.32,Sub-JP-NEW,这里的⤴加到さ的上面,0,0,0,,「かなさん」　だだだ言ってみて
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.32,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,995.22)}「我愛你」試著再說一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かなさーん　おーい!　かなさーん!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.96,Sub-CN-Mark,四个“夏菜” 的上面标上小字“我爱你”,0,0,0,,{\pos(835.683,960)}我愛你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.96,Sub-CN-Mark,四个“夏菜” 的上面标上小字“我爱你”,0,0,0,,{\pos(1067.05,960)}我愛你
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.96,Sub-CN-NEW,四个“夏菜” 的上面标上小字“我爱你”,0,0,0,,夏菜 喂! 夏菜!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かなさーん?　かなさーん
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.96,Sub-CN-Mark,四个“夏菜” 的上面标上小字“我爱你”,0,0,0,,{\pos(880.576,960)}我愛你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.96,Sub-CN-Mark,四个“夏菜” 的上面标上小字“我爱你”,0,0,0,,{\pos(1039.424,960)}我愛你
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.96,Sub-CN-NEW,四个“夏菜” 的上面标上小字“我爱你”,0,0,0,,夏菜? 夏菜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:18.48,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あれ　聞こえてない?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.79,0:09:18.48,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯 沒聽見嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.48,0:09:22.08,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あいねーねー彼氏に返事してあげないとー
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.48,0:09:22.08,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,喂喂 小姐姐 不回應你男朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:26.04,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ちがいます!　てーるーもかーなーって呼んで
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.59,0:09:26.04,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不是的  阿照 別那樣叫我了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:33.03,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,イーヤーサーサー　沖ツラ!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.16,0:09:33.03,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,一二三 沖繩話 不簡單!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:46.74,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,俺は中村照秋　この春　沖縄に来た
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.21,0:09:46.74,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我叫中村照秋 這個春天 我來到了沖繩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:51.54,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,好きな人も出来て　そして今…
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.98,0:09:51.54,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,也有了喜歡的人 如今…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.69,0:09:56.51,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,迷子!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.69,0:09:56.51,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,迷路的孩子!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.32,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,大丈夫か…?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.32,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,沒事嗎…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.75,0:10:01.59,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ガムいる…?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.75,0:10:01.59,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,要口香糖嗎…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.63,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,どこか痛…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.63,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哪裡覺得痛嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.59,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,おんどりゃあー!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.59,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你滾!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.57,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ちょ…すごいな　君…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.96,0:10:11.57,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哇…你好厲害啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.04,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.04,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.45,0:10:21.28,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え?　なんて…?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.45,0:10:21.28,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊? 什麼意思…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:25.11,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,好きな人が方言すぎてツラすぎる
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.47,0:10:25.11,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜歡的人方言味太重我太難了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.98,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「子供が泣いているのー?」ってうちなーぐちで言ってるさー
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.98,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她在用沖繩語問你「小孩子在哭嗎?」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.95,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,たやが?　迷子ねー?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.95,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,他是誰? 迷路了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.68,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「誰?　迷子?」ってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.68,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她說 「他是誰? 迷路了嗎?」
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:39.12,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あ…うん　お母さんを探して転んじゃったみたいで…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.06,0:10:39.12,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯…在找媽媽的時候摔倒了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.12,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,転んでびっくりしたねぇ
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.12,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,摔倒嚇到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:47.33,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,まぶやぁ～　まぶやぁ～　う～てぃく～よ～
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.65,0:10:47.33,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,天靈靈～ 地靈靈～ 魂歸來～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.25,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,まぶやぁ～　まぶやぁ～　う～てぃく～よ～
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.25,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,天靈靈～ 地靈靈～ 魂歸來～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.82,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉さん　これって何…?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.82,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉 這是在幹什麼呀…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.52,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え?　あっ　これは…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.52,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哦? 這個啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:02.41,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「マブイグミ」
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.43,0:11:02.41,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,「喊魂」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:10.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖縄では　驚いた拍子に　魂(マブイ)が落ちると言われている
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.20,0:11:10.96,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,在沖繩 據說人受到驚嚇 靈魂就會從身上掉落
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.76,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,魂が落ちた人は生気が抜けた様になる
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.85,0:11:14.76,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,成為失魂落魄的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:16.90,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そこで登場するのが…
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.76,0:11:16.90,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,此時就會有…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.28,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「ユタ」と呼ばれる沖縄のシャーマン
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.28,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,被稱為「由塔」的沖繩薩滿登場
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:23.95,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,まぶやぁ～　まぶやぁ～　う～てぃく～よ～
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.62,0:11:23.95,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,天靈靈～ 地靈靈～ 魂歸來～
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.03,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,おまじないを唱えれば
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.95,0:11:26.03,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,吟唱咒文之後
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:32.15,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんと魂が戻ってくるっと言われているのだ
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.20,0:11:32.15,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,靈魂就會回到本尊身上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.80,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,それの名残でおばあがやるわけさー
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.80,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這是這邊流傳下來的風俗 奶奶那輩還在做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:39.68,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,私もおばあによくやられるねー
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.41,0:11:39.68,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,對我來說也是家常便飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:40.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,へえ～
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.97,0:11:40.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:44.44,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,お母さんのとこ行くー!!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.80,0:11:44.44,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我要去找媽媽!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.84,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,落ち着いて　きっと大丈夫だから
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.84,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,冷靜點 一定沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:48.14,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,どこ!?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.84,0:11:48.14,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,在哪裡啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:54.69,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,狭い沖縄　そんなに急いでどこに行く～?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.81,0:11:54.69,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖繩就這麼點大 著急去哪呢~?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.78,0:12:29.66,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かーずー!!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.78,0:12:29.66,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,小和!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.85,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,お母さん!!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.85,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,媽媽!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.19,0:12:33.72,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ね
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.19,0:12:33.72,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.22,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ねーねー　あのさふん
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.22,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,姐姐 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.61,0:12:44.31,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんねー?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.61,0:12:44.31,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,怎麼啦?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.75,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ねーねーが言ってたのさ
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.75,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,剛剛姐姐說的那些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.40,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,半分ぐらい分からんかった
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.40,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,有一半我沒聽懂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.05,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,もう一回お願い
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.05,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你能不能再說一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.62,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,はっさ…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.62,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哦豁…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:59.28,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,若者のうちなーぐち離れは深刻どー…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.59,0:12:59.28,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,現在的年輕人是越來越聽不懂沖繩話了…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:03.95,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あっえっと　半分は分かったからさ　元気出して!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.59,0:13:03.95,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那個 我還是聽懂一半了 打起精神來!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.51,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,逆に励まされてる
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.51,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,反而被小孩鼓勵了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:07.86,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あははは…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.51,0:13:07.86,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:12.17,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あのさ…おばあがいっちょんたんど…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.99,0:13:12.17,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那個呢 奶奶曾經說過…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:17.38,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖縄のおじい　おばあは　さよならとはあまり言わない
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.17,0:13:17.38,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖繩的老爺爺老奶奶不會輕易說離別
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:18.86,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,分かれる時は
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.67,0:13:18.86,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,在分開的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:26.37,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,それは　島にいればいつかまた会えるという気持ちがあるから
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.07,0:13:26.37,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,在他們看來 只要還在島上就一定會再次相見
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:29.29,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,でもおじいとおばあ曰く
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.03,0:13:29.29,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,但他們也說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.09,0:13:36.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,もっと深い気持ちがこめられているはず
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.09,0:13:36.96,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,裡面肯定蘊含了更深層的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.36,0:13:42.44,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あぬわらばよー　かえらんばーしてたねー
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.36,0:13:42.44,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那個孩子 好像不想回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.37,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えー
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.37,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:47.43,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「あの子　帰りたくなさそうだったね」ってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.37,0:13:47.43,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她說「那個孩子好像不想回去啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:49.64,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そうだね
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.70,0:13:49.64,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.95,0:13:54.86,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんだか　ほっこりしたな
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.95,0:13:54.86,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,真是心暖烘烘的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.02,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,いいもの見た…
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.02,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,見到了好東西啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.45,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー　前前ー
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.45,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 看前面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.85,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,これ　ヌー?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.85,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這是?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:07.60,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あ　にーにー　ごめんね
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.14,0:14:07.60,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不好意思呀小哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:11.35,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あいえな　てーる－　大丈夫ね?　牛だよ
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.08,0:14:11.35,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 沒事吧? 那是牛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:14.44,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うん…でも　なんで牛が?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.96,0:14:14.44,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,還好…不過為什麼會有牛?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:17.21,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,もうすぐ闘牛の時期だから
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.07,0:14:17.21,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,快要到鬥牛季了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.76,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,浜でトレーニングさせてるんだはず
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.76,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,應該是被帶到海邊鍛鍊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:20.78,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,闘牛?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.03,0:14:20.78,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,鬥牛?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.97,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,暖かくなったら闘牛シーズンよ
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.97,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,天氣變暖後就到鬥牛的時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:26.73,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,いやでも　びっくりした
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.37,0:14:26.73,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是嘛…剛才真是嚇到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:31.60,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,はっさ　てーるー　あんたびっくりしすぎて　マブイ落としたんじゃない
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.73,0:14:31.60,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 你不會被嚇破膽 靈魂掉出來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:34.08,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えっ?　ハハハ大丈夫…
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.96,0:14:34.08,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯? 我沒事的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:36.11,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,だぁ　マブイグミしとおこうねー
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.08,0:14:36.11,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,來來 我來給你喊魂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.61,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え!?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.61,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:38.60,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,だぁ
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.00,0:14:38.60,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,來來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:41.16,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,さっきのあれを俺に!?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.55,0:14:41.16,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,要對我做剛剛那個嗎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:42.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え!?まじで!?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.54,0:14:42.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不會吧!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.76,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜屋武さん　それは　ちょっと…!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.15,0:14:44.76,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜屋武同學 那個也太…!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:50.59,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,まぶやぁー　まぶやぁー　うーてぃくーよー!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.81,0:14:50.59,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,天靈靈 地靈靈 魂歸來!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:54.31,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,まぶやぁー　まぶやぁー　うーてぃくーよー!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.39,0:14:54.31,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,天靈靈 地靈靈 魂歸來!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.05,0:14:58.07,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,まぶやぁー　まぶやぁー　うーてぃくーよー!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.05,0:14:58.07,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,天靈靈 地靈靈 魂歸來!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:58.07,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,さっきのと　違くね?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.03,0:14:58.07,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,好像和剛才不太一樣啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:02.33,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,子供と違って　大人のマブイは大きいからねー
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.92,0:15:02.33,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,大人和小孩不一樣 大人的靈魂要大好多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.10,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,これくらいやらんとー
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.66,0:15:04.10,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不用點力可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:10.39,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,実際おばぁがやるマブヤグミは痛いくらい本気で叩くさー
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.63,0:15:10.39,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,實際上奶奶拍的力道大得會讓人發疼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:14.22,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あいよ　おじいー　フンはもって帰れよー
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.72,0:15:14.22,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,大叔 要記得把牛糞帶回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.39,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あたぼーさー
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.39,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那必須撒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.44,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ま…まぶやぁ　まぶやぁ…
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.44,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,天靈靈…地靈靈…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:30.86,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,牛の時よりびっくり…いや　ドキドキしたてーるーであった
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.02,0:15:30.86,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比見到牛時更驚心動魄…不 是小鹿亂撞的阿照
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.38,0:15:34.22,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖ツラ!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.38,0:15:34.22,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖繩話 不簡單!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.96,0:15:39.79,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えってーるー　サーターアンダギー食べたことないばー!?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.96,0:15:39.79,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,什麼阿照 你沒吃過炸糖蛋球!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:45.11,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そのサーター…ごめんなにそれ?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.82,0:15:45.11,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,抱歉…那個是什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.38,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,サーターアンダギー知らんば!?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.38,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你真不知道炸糖蛋球啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:51.98,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,サーター（砂糖）をアンダ（油）で
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.18,0:15:51.98,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,砂糖 用油炸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:54.84,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,アギー（揚げた）その名の通り
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.98,0:15:54.84,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,故名炸糖蛋球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:57.89,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,砂糖を混ぜた生地を使った揚げ菓子である
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.84,0:15:57.89,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這是加上了砂糖 將原材料揉成球後的油炸食品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.61,0:16:00.45,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,出来立てが美味シーサー
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.61,0:16:00.45,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,剛炸出來的很好吃撒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.26,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,へえー　美味しいそうだね
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.19,0:16:03.26,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,好像很好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.44,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,食べてみたいなー
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.44,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,真想吃吃看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.40,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うぉっ　まぶしっ!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.40,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,哇 好刺眼!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:11.21,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー　明日　おばあの作ったサーターアンダギー　むっちちゅーさ
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.40,0:16:11.21,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 明天我把阿婆做的炸糖蛋球 帶過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:14.33,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えっマジ?　ありがとう　下地くん!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.40,0:16:14.33,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,真的嗎? 謝謝你 下地!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:19.97,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー　昔仲間商店で働いていたおばあのサーターアンダギー持って来ようね
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.71,0:16:19.97,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 我把以前在伙伴商店工作過的阿婆做的炸糖蛋球帶過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:21.86,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,仲間商店ってどこ?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.40,0:16:21.86,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,伙伴商店是在哪裡?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:24.21,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あ…ありがとう　安慶名さん
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.13,0:16:24.21,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,謝…謝謝你 安慶名
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:26.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー　俺は作ってきてあげるさ
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.60,0:16:26.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 我做給你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.19,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えっ作れるの?　上間くん
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.19,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你會做嗎? 上間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.85,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,出た!　天ぷら屋の長男!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.85,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,出現了! 天婦羅店的長男!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:33.68,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,俺のも食べてみれよ!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.10,0:16:33.68,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你也吃吃我家的吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:34.75,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,私のも!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.68,0:16:34.75,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,還有我家的!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.75,0:16:37.09,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うちのおかあも商店で働いているから!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.75,0:16:37.09,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我家媽媽也有在商店工作!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.85,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ちょっとみんな急にどうしたの?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.85,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,大家等等 突然怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.84,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,これはまさか…モテ期!?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.84,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,難道…我的桃花期來了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:46.48,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー…あんたは今…
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.64,0:16:46.48,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照…你現在…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:52.28,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うちなー名物　「カメーカメー攻撃」を受けているわけさー
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.47,0:16:52.28,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,正在接受這邊的特產 「卡美卡美攻擊」的衝擊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:53.12,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なにそれ!?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.28,0:16:53.12,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那是什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:58.65,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,カメーカメー攻撃とは
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.50,0:16:58.65,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,所謂卡美卡美攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.17,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,おばあちゃんの家に行った時に限界まで食べさせられること
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.04,0:17:02.17,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是指去奶奶家玩的時候被撐到一點也吃不下的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:05.61,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あれに　沖縄では名前がついているのだ
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.57,0:17:05.61,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖繩為這種情況取了名稱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.63,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんで攻撃っててけちゃったの
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.63,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,為什麼要加上攻擊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.99,0:17:11.11,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ちなみに　うちなーぐちでは「カメ」は「噛め」
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.99,0:17:11.11,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,順帶一提 沖繩語裡的「卡美」是「咬」的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:12.84,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,つまり「食え」という意味
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.39,0:17:12.84,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,也就是「吃吧」的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:19.42,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,カメカメ攻撃の発動条件は親族　友人が訪ねて来た時
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.33,0:17:19.42,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,卡美卡美攻擊的發動條件 是親友來做客的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:20.46,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そして…
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.69,0:17:20.46,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,以及…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:31.67,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,県外の人が食べたことのない沖縄料理を見つけた時
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.74,0:17:31.67,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,發現縣外人士沒有吃過的沖繩料理時
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:38.32,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,島だからこそ県民の郷土愛は凄まじく
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.08,0:17:38.32,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,因為是島嶼縣 縣民的鄉土情非常強烈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:40.91,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,時には圏外の人へ猛威を振るう
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.32,0:17:40.91,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,所以不時會對縣外人士發動猛攻
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.58,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,繰り返しが県民の郷土愛…
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.58,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,再重申一遍 是因為縣民的鄉土情…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:47.17,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そしておもてなしの精神から来ているものである
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.58,0:17:47.17,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,以及熱情好客的精神所產生的現象
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.01,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,怖いよ!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.01,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,很恐怖啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.46,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,カメー! カメー!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.46,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,卡美!卡美!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.61,0:17:53.74,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そしてそれは彼女も例外ではなかった
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.61,0:17:53.74,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這對少女來說也不例外
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:56.93,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かーなーも作るんでしょう?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.19,0:17:56.93,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,夏菜也要做吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.80,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あんた得意さー
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.80,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是你的拿手料理撒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:04.06,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるー　俺のもだよ!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.28,0:18:04.06,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 也別忘了我哦!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:06.19,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,う…うん　ありがとう
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.06,0:18:06.19,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗯… 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:10.73,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ついでにわんのもお願い～
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.34,0:18:10.73,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,也順便給我做一份吧~
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:13.60,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かーなーのサーターアンダギー大好きだからよ
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.73,0:18:13.60,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡吃夏菜做的炸糖蛋球了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:19.20,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うわあああああ!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.42,0:18:19.20,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,嗚哇啊啊啊啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.70,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,やってやったで…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.70,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,終於給出去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:22.22,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,スッキリ…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.14,0:18:22.22,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,清爽了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:26.74,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,うりー　てーるー　これー
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.40,0:18:26.74,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照 這個給你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.11,0:18:28.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,喜屋武さんが作ってくれたの!?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.11,0:18:28.96,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,是喜屋武同學做的嗎!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.90,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あらんよー　あばぁの手作りさー
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.32,0:18:31.90,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,不是哦 是我阿婆親手做的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.43,0:18:34.11,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そ…そうだよね
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.43,0:18:34.11,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我想也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.97,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,こんなにたくさん…ありがとう
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.97,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,竟然有這麼多…謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:38.90,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あい　かーなー　おはよ!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.34,0:18:38.90,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,夏菜 早安!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.47,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,おはよう　比嘉さん
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.39,0:18:40.47,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,早安 比嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:41.69,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,おはよ…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.84,0:18:41.69,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,早安…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.62,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉さん　どうしたの?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.98,0:18:48.62,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉 你怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.51,0:18:52.97,Sub-JP-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,い…いや　なんでも…
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.51,0:18:52.97,Sub-CN-UP-NEW,,0,0,0,,不不… 沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:58.35,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え…えっと
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.67,0:18:58.35,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那…那個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:18:59.46,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,どうしたの?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.67,0:18:59.46,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.51,0:19:08.38,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,言え…言え私…!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.51,0:19:08.38,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,說啊…快說出口…!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:12.46,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,渡せなかった…
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.97,0:19:12.46,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,還是沒能給他…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:18.39,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんでよ私…ただあげるって言うだけさー
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.77,0:19:18.39,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我怎麼會搞成這樣…只要說一句送給你就可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:24.03,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,朝でみんなと一緒にあげたら自然に渡せてたのに…なんでよ私!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.29,0:19:24.03,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,要是早上和大家一起給就能自然地送給他了…我怎麼搞成這樣!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.03,0:19:24.62,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉さん
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.03,0:19:24.62,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.62,0:19:27.40,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,大丈夫?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.62,0:19:27.40,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.79,0:19:30.24,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,な…なにが?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.79,0:19:30.24,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你…你說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.50,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,今日元気なかったから
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.50,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我看你今天沒什麼精神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:36.68,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,だ…だいじょうぶ　じゃ…じゃあね
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.03,0:19:36.68,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我…我沒事…待會見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:43.01,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,心配して来てくれた　優しい　嬉しい!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.56,0:19:43.01,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,他是因為擔心我才過來的 他好溫柔 好開心!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:44.41,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,かーなー
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.01,0:19:44.41,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,夏菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:46.87,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,けーら　けーらー
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.33,0:19:46.87,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,回去吧 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:56.58,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ちょ…ひーなー!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.32,0:19:56.58,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,等…飛夏!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.16,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え　なんて?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.16,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:00.97,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あ…わかってない
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.49,0:20:00.97,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,他…他沒聽懂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:06.48,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,でも今のひーなーが言ったことを訳せば…そしたら
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.12,0:20:06.48,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,不過 如果把剛才飛夏說的翻譯給他…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:09.73,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,「かーなーのサーターアンダギーも美味しかったでしょう」ってよ
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.48,0:20:09.73,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,她說「夏菜的炸糖蛋球也很好吃吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:13.64,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,え　ということは比嘉さんも作ってきてくれたの?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.12,0:20:13.64,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,那就是說 比嘉你也有做給我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:17.35,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あちゃ～バレた～はいこれ～
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.96,0:20:17.35,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊哈~ 被你發現啦~ 給你~
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:18.50,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あざまーす!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.35,0:20:18.50,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,謝謝!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:21.09,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,訳したら自然に言えるかも…
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.05,0:20:21.09,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,翻譯過來也許就能自然地說出來了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.95,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ありがとう　ひーなー
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.62,0:20:23.95,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,謝謝你 飛夏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:29.12,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あ…「かーなーのサーターアンダギー…」
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.83,0:20:29.12,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,啊…「夏菜的炸糖蛋球…」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.90,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,やっぱりダメだ…
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.90,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這樣不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:47.28,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,自分の言葉で渡さないとダメだ
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.23,0:20:47.28,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我必須用自己的話告訴他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.78,0:20:51.57,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,これ…作ってきたから
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.78,0:20:51.57,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,這些…是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:20:59.53,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,ありがとう
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.64,0:20:59.53,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:05.72,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,あー比嘉さんのカメーカメー攻撃は遅れて来たね
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.98,0:21:05.72,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,比嘉的卡美卡美攻擊有點姍姍來遲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:22.01,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,えー　いるやっし!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.58,0:21:22.01,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,在這裡!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:26.51,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,サーターアンダギー食べたことない中村照秋ってヤーか?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.45,0:21:26.51,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,你就是沒吃過炸糖蛋球的那個中村照秋嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.37,0:21:42.78,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,カツレン高校から来ました　中村照秋くんいますか?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.37,0:21:42.78,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我是從勝連高中來的 中村照秋同學在嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:46.66,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,隣町から来ました　中村照秋くんはいますー?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.12,0:21:46.66,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我是從隔壁鎮來的 中村照秋同學在嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.98,0:21:47.96,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,てーるーは…
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.98,0:21:47.96,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,阿照現在…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:56.59,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,みんな…ありがとう
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.98,0:21:56.59,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,大家…謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.66,0:21:59.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,俺のも食べてみれ!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.66,0:21:59.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,我的也嚐嚐看!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:00.93,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,私のも食べて!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.81,0:22:00.93,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,還有我的也!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.29,0:22:02.17,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,食べてみて!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.29,0:22:02.17,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,吃吃看吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:05.13,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,沖縄のみんさん　ありがとう!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.17,0:22:05.13,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,感謝你們的厚愛 沖繩!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.55,0:22:10.81,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,そして　宜しくお願いします!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.55,0:22:10.81,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,今後也請多多指教!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.24,0:23:41.04,Sub-JP-NEW,,0,0,0,,なんて!?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.24,0:23:41.04,Sub-CN-NEW,,0,0,0,,什麼!?
